WEBVTT

00:00:01.934 --> 00:00:05.734
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.205 --> 00:00:10.005
Delivers this message

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:19.010
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.152 --> 00:00:20.620
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:28.728
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:29.023
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:36.532
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:40.899
But please don't look back

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:45.067
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:49.374
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:53.085
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.352 --> 00:00:57.254
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.657 --> 00:01:01.388
Delivers this message

00:01:01.827 --> 00:01:09.996
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.369 --> 00:01:18.572
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.011 --> 00:01:28.682
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:33.025 --> 00:01:36.358
A situation where one is
assigned to menial tasks...

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:39.296
...and given little opportunity to prove
one's abilities is referred to as...

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:41.060
..."the lowest of the low".

00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:45.102
Next I need to clean
the toilets over there.

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:54.269
Despite having legitimately passed...

00:01:54.347 --> 00:01:56.144
...the National Civil
Service Examinations...

00:01:56.215 --> 00:01:59.446
...Shurei Hong and Eigetsu To are
currently experiencing the difficulties...

00:01:59.518 --> 00:02:02.954
...and hardships that come with
being regarded as the lowest of the low.

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:05.251
Okay, I'm done.

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:17.258
A Child Knows Not
of His Parent's Feelings

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:26.237
What a heart-wrenching sigh.

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:28.940
That expression on your face
is quite a turn-on.

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:32.616
Cut it out with your jokes!
I'm in a lousy mood right now!

00:02:33.819 --> 00:02:36.049
Lady Shurei is working hard,
I understand.

00:02:37.623 --> 00:02:39.989
But will she be able to
keep it up, I wonder.

00:02:40.059 --> 00:02:42.721
If this continues,
I'm sure he will make his move.

00:02:43.896 --> 00:02:46.126
He could very well
have already made his move.

00:02:46.198 --> 00:02:49.827
I suppose so. His sweet little niece
is being mistreated.

00:02:50.069 --> 00:02:52.037
He's probably gone to the king...

00:02:52.104 --> 00:02:54.732
...to give him a word or two
or three of what's on his mind.

00:02:55.207 --> 00:02:58.472
I understand that you've decided
to keep this year's top twenty initiates...

00:02:58.544 --> 00:03:02.275
...within the Imperial Court
for observation.

00:03:02.348 --> 00:03:05.545
I heard that this was done at times
during my father's reign.

00:03:05.618 --> 00:03:09.019
Yes. Such was the case during my year,
and Koyu's as well.

00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:10.754
When it's difficult to determine...

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:13.053
...where to assign those in the top tier
with exceptional talent...

00:03:13.125 --> 00:03:15.150
...this is generally how
it's dealt with.

00:03:16.228 --> 00:03:18.025
Well, I suppose
it's the proper thing to do.

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:20.327
If both Shurei Hong and Eigetsu To
were assigned...

00:03:20.399 --> 00:03:22.390
...to one of the ministries now...

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:26.097
...they'd be beaten down before they had
a chance to prove their abilities after all.

00:03:26.505 --> 00:03:28.268
That would be a shame indeed.

00:03:28.340 --> 00:03:30.409
You, for instance,
would despise anyone...

00:03:30.409 --> 00:03:31.899
...who failed to prove
their abilities...

00:03:31.977 --> 00:03:33.808
...and would be
quick to discard them.

00:03:33.879 --> 00:03:35.710
Of course I would discard
such a person.

00:03:35.781 --> 00:03:37.749
Those incapable of applying
their talents...

00:03:37.817 --> 00:03:40.479
...in the positions so graciously
given to them deserve no less.

00:03:40.553 --> 00:03:44.045
I detest the weak,
the spoiled and the stupid.

00:03:44.724 --> 00:03:46.851
That includes you,
as you were before.

00:03:48.861 --> 00:03:51.694
However, this time the conditions
are too extreme.

00:03:51.997 --> 00:03:55.398
This is like rashly
tossing seedlings into water.

00:03:56.001 --> 00:03:59.164
There is an obligation to rescue them
and place them on secure ground.

00:03:59.238 --> 00:04:02.401
Otherwise regardless of how hard
they try, they will only end up rotting.

00:04:02.475 --> 00:04:05.103
There's no need to worry.
I will protect your niece.

00:04:05.177 --> 00:04:06.371
I give you my word.

00:04:07.546 --> 00:04:09.639
You were the one who
put forward the proposal...

00:04:09.715 --> 00:04:11.945
...and opened the examination
system to women, Your Majesty.

00:04:12.384 --> 00:04:15.376
If you cannot properly maintain a system
you yourself established...

00:04:15.454 --> 00:04:19.220
...I will not hesitate to desert you.
Excuse me.

00:04:19.625 --> 00:04:20.887
Secretary Hong.

00:04:21.794 --> 00:04:24.695
Thank you for standing as
Shurei's sponsor.

00:04:25.464 --> 00:04:28.956
I did not in any way,
do it for you, Your Majesty.

00:04:30.803 --> 00:04:34.204
To be honest,
I'm actually very fond of you.

00:04:34.273 --> 00:04:38.539
If you think your flattery is going
to get you anywhere, think again.

00:04:43.516 --> 00:04:46.917
I came here, hoping to find some
comfort by seeing my big brother.

00:04:47.253 --> 00:04:50.245
Unfortunately, Shoka is out of town
on official business.

00:04:50.322 --> 00:04:52.256
Darn! If I could have it my way...

00:04:52.324 --> 00:04:55.259
...I'd immediately fire every one
of those who mistreat Shurei!

00:04:55.661 --> 00:04:58.186
Coming from the Senior Secretary
of the Ministry of Civil Affairs...

00:04:58.264 --> 00:05:00.630
...in charge of all personnel,
we can't take that statement too lightly.

00:05:00.699 --> 00:05:04.430
If the king still doesn't take action
after my threats, I really will desert him.

00:05:04.603 --> 00:05:07.436
- As suspected.
- He went to see the king.

00:05:07.506 --> 00:05:10.407
Reishin, even though
you're her sponsor...

00:05:10.476 --> 00:05:13.809
...if you interfere too much, you'll end up
causing Shurei unneeded trouble.

00:05:13.879 --> 00:05:17.645
That's precisely why I haven't made
public the fact that I'm her sponsor.

00:05:17.716 --> 00:05:19.149
Oh, Reishin!

00:05:20.152 --> 00:05:21.585
Fancy seeing you here.

00:05:21.654 --> 00:05:22.678
Dear brother!

00:05:22.755 --> 00:05:24.780
Those peach buns look delicious!

00:05:24.857 --> 00:05:27.052
I brought them for you,
dear brother!

00:05:27.126 --> 00:05:29.458
Thank you. Then I think I'll
help myself to one right now.

00:05:29.528 --> 00:05:30.324
Sure!

00:05:30.396 --> 00:05:33.388
You know,
I was just getting hungry.

00:05:33.465 --> 00:05:34.432
Really?

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.968
All right, then.
Let's go ahead and enjoy them.

00:05:46.212 --> 00:05:48.840
It's clear that the person
most important to Reishin is...!

00:05:51.317 --> 00:05:52.443
Koyu?

00:05:54.854 --> 00:05:57.618
Please excuse me.
I'm a newly conferred official...

00:05:57.690 --> 00:06:00.591
...and with the difference in our ranks
I know I shouldn't be...

00:06:00.659 --> 00:06:02.752
...talking with you
so casually, but...!

00:06:02.828 --> 00:06:03.658
But?

00:06:03.729 --> 00:06:06.721
Has something happened
to leave you depressed?

00:06:09.201 --> 00:06:12.602
Oh, right! There's something
I wanted to ask you, Koyu.

00:06:13.038 --> 00:06:13.936
What is it?

00:06:14.006 --> 00:06:17.533
You took the Jogen title
at age sixteen, right?

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:19.077
What of it?

00:06:19.144 --> 00:06:22.011
What was it that you desired, Koyu?

00:06:22.081 --> 00:06:24.447
What were the strong desires
that supported you...

00:06:24.516 --> 00:06:26.984
...as you worked your way
to where you are now?

00:06:29.488 --> 00:06:31.581
My desires were simple.

00:06:32.224 --> 00:06:35.387
I wanted to stay by a particular
person's side, and be useful to him.

00:06:35.995 --> 00:06:40.762
That person has given me so much.
I want to somehow repay that kindness.

00:06:41.667 --> 00:06:45.626
That's all there is to it. In comparison
to yours, my motive isn't too pure, is it?

00:06:46.305 --> 00:06:48.865
Were you able
to fulfill that desire?

00:06:49.541 --> 00:06:50.769
Who knows.

00:06:50.843 --> 00:06:55.371
To that person, it probably makes
little difference whether I'm here or not.

00:06:56.081 --> 00:07:00.245
But being supported by your feelings
for someone else is really wonderful.

00:07:02.521 --> 00:07:04.250
I'd better keep trying, too!

00:07:06.959 --> 00:07:09.223
I'll bring you
some refreshments later.

00:07:09.295 --> 00:07:10.728
Thank you very much.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:19.801
Oh, Koyu. Is something the matter?
Is there a problem?

00:07:20.272 --> 00:07:22.001
"Is there a problem"?

00:07:22.074 --> 00:07:23.063
Secretary Sai.

00:07:23.142 --> 00:07:25.667
You're the one responsible for
instructing the newly conferred officials...

00:07:25.744 --> 00:07:27.905
...aren't you?
- Do you have a problem with that?

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:29.515
Does it not bother you
to see...

00:07:29.515 --> 00:07:31.847
...what Shurei Hong and Eigetsu To
are going through?!

00:07:31.917 --> 00:07:33.976
There's no point in
bringing that up with me.

00:07:34.053 --> 00:07:38.786
It was Official Ro who assigned them
to toilet cleaning and shoe polishing.

00:07:38.857 --> 00:07:40.825
But more importantly, Koyu...

00:07:41.794 --> 00:07:44.729
...although you're Secretary Hong's
adopted son...

00:07:44.797 --> 00:07:48.130
...I understand that he has yet
to grant you the Hong family name.

00:07:48.934 --> 00:07:51.402
Secretary Hong has
no children of his own...

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:53.438
...so this could only mean that...

00:07:53.505 --> 00:07:55.973
...he has no intention of bringing you
into the Hong family.

00:07:56.508 --> 00:07:59.375
Dear me, that man is so capricious
and cold-hearted.

00:07:59.445 --> 00:08:03.176
It wouldn't surprise me if he
threw you out at the drop of a hat.

00:08:03.515 --> 00:08:05.813
I, on the other hand,
value your ability.

00:08:05.884 --> 00:08:08.352
I'm no longer angry about that incident.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:11.617
If you should find yourself on your own,
I'd be willing to...!

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:12.850
Excuse me.

00:08:32.711 --> 00:08:35.942
- What are you selling there?
- Lots.

00:08:36.015 --> 00:08:37.073
I see.

00:08:37.149 --> 00:08:39.640
Is that junk you have there
prizes in the lottery?

00:08:39.718 --> 00:08:41.811
If you're trying to make trouble,
please don't bother.

00:08:51.463 --> 00:08:52.487
Go ahead.

00:08:58.137 --> 00:08:59.434
Your consolation prize.

00:09:00.372 --> 00:09:02.033
Plum blossoms.

00:09:02.107 --> 00:09:05.372
I suppose there aren't many winning
tokens in there anyway, are there?

00:09:05.911 --> 00:09:09.506
It's a pretty good business. Did your
parents come up with this idea?

00:09:10.916 --> 00:09:12.884
I don't have any parents.

00:09:20.893 --> 00:09:22.861
All right. You will do.

00:09:27.399 --> 00:09:29.560
He only took me in on a whim.

00:09:30.269 --> 00:09:32.897
Much like bringing home a stray pup.

00:09:32.971 --> 00:09:35.633
What are you doing
standing around out there?

00:09:36.775 --> 00:09:40.506
Have I not always told you
to ask for directions if you get lost?

00:09:40.913 --> 00:09:43.108
I was just admiring
the plum blossoms.

00:09:43.582 --> 00:09:47.814
But may I ask what's troubling you?
You seem to be in quite a bad mood.

00:09:49.755 --> 00:09:52.747
You're the one who's troubled, Koyu.

00:09:54.293 --> 00:09:56.158
It's... nothing.

00:09:57.996 --> 00:09:59.759
Well, all right, then.

00:09:59.832 --> 00:10:02.164
It seems that the main branch of the
Hong family has sent someone here.

00:10:02.234 --> 00:10:03.792
The main Hong branch?

00:10:03.869 --> 00:10:05.666
Although I find it unlikely...

00:10:05.737 --> 00:10:08.467
...if they approach you at home,
kick them out immediately.

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:10.565
Nothing good would
bring them here, after all.

00:10:15.814 --> 00:10:17.611
What is it?

00:10:17.683 --> 00:10:19.913
I-If I said I wanted to leave
your side...

00:10:19.985 --> 00:10:23.682
...take a journey around the country and
practice the art of making dim sum...

00:10:24.022 --> 00:10:25.512
...what would you do?

00:10:25.591 --> 00:10:28.185
You? Practice making dim sum?

00:10:29.528 --> 00:10:31.428
What on earth am I saying?

00:10:33.065 --> 00:10:36.694
You have no sense of direction. How
will you get anywhere on a journey?

00:10:36.768 --> 00:10:38.292
Never mind that.

00:10:40.606 --> 00:10:43.131
If that's what you want to do,
then go ahead.

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:47.608
It's your life. You needn't ask me.

00:10:59.958 --> 00:11:04.918
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:11:14.773 --> 00:11:16.968
Taking a journey to learn
may not be a bad idea.

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:24.206
This is odd. I was sure this was
the way to the Archives.

00:11:32.491 --> 00:11:35.051
You're on your way to the Archives,
aren't you? I'll go with you.

00:11:39.464 --> 00:11:41.432
Shurei, I've brought refreshments.

00:11:42.334 --> 00:11:43.460
Koyu!

00:11:45.771 --> 00:11:47.671
I made some dim sum
at home.

00:11:47.739 --> 00:11:49.502
Your home, Koyu?

00:11:49.575 --> 00:11:53.033
If I remember correctly, you're staying
at someone else's estate, right?

00:11:54.112 --> 00:11:57.843
Well, I'm staying with the family
that's taken care of me...

00:11:57.916 --> 00:11:59.440
...since I was young.

00:11:59.518 --> 00:12:01.577
That aside, have these
while they're still warm.

00:12:07.192 --> 00:12:09.057
Go ahead.
No need to hesitate.

00:12:10.762 --> 00:12:12.730
Oh, the shrimp is very succulent!

00:12:13.298 --> 00:12:15.266
The crab dumpling
is delicious too!

00:12:15.334 --> 00:12:17.461
They may not look too great,
but they're quite tasty!

00:12:17.536 --> 00:12:19.436
- Eigetsu!
- Oh, sorry.

00:12:19.504 --> 00:12:22.098
W-Well, I'll try
a shrimp dumpling next.

00:12:28.747 --> 00:12:31.614
That was delicious.
Thank you so much.

00:12:31.683 --> 00:12:33.310
That'll give us the energy
to keep going.

00:12:33.385 --> 00:12:36.149
You're right.
Shall we get back to work?

00:12:39.091 --> 00:12:41.389
The two of you
are really hanging in there.

00:12:42.294 --> 00:12:44.387
Even in the face of such hardship.

00:12:45.597 --> 00:12:48.157
The hardest thing to deal with is...

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:50.200
...having to see those
most important to us...

00:12:50.269 --> 00:12:51.930
...bear with sadness and suffering.

00:12:52.004 --> 00:12:53.596
We're determined to work hard...

00:12:53.672 --> 00:12:55.936
...to create a country
where that doesn't exist.

00:12:56.008 --> 00:13:01.469
Although we don't know if our efforts
will actually help Saiunkoku.

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:21.529
Did Koyu just exit the Archives?

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:23.067
It would appear so.

00:13:23.135 --> 00:13:27.731
I believe Shurei Hong and Eigetsu To
are in the Archives right now.

00:13:27.806 --> 00:13:31.298
From what I've heard, before
Shurei Hong took the aptitude test...

00:13:31.376 --> 00:13:35.176
...Koyu often visited the Hong estate
and assisted her in her studies.

00:13:35.247 --> 00:13:37.681
You could say the king crafted
the aptitude test system...

00:13:37.749 --> 00:13:40.274
...specifically for Shurei Hong.

00:13:40.585 --> 00:13:41.847
Originally, in order to sit...

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:44.480
...for the final part
of the National Civil Service Exams...

00:13:44.556 --> 00:13:46.820
...one would need
to spend at least a year...

00:13:46.892 --> 00:13:48.985
...passing various qualification tests.

00:13:49.394 --> 00:13:51.362
However, in Shurei Hong's case...

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:53.227
...she was allowed
to take the final exam...

00:13:53.298 --> 00:13:55.163
...after only passing
the aptitude test.

00:13:55.233 --> 00:13:57.599
But the exam itself was
quite difficult...

00:13:57.669 --> 00:13:59.967
...because of such
extenuating circumstances.

00:14:00.038 --> 00:14:03.804
Still, Shurei Hong has been extremely
fortunate from any angle you look at it.

00:14:03.942 --> 00:14:05.204
What are you getting at?

00:14:05.277 --> 00:14:07.074
In order to participate in
the National Examinations...

00:14:07.145 --> 00:14:10.114
...a woman needs the support of a
high-ranking official or grand noble.

00:14:10.182 --> 00:14:14.141
I hear that in Shurei Hong's case,
Reishin Hong is her sponsor.

00:14:23.895 --> 00:14:25.863
My! Now this is unusual.

00:14:25.931 --> 00:14:27.865
To find you drinking wine.

00:14:27.933 --> 00:14:29.230
Go away.

00:14:29.835 --> 00:14:31.769
If you're feeling Ionely,
I'll join you.

00:14:31.837 --> 00:14:33.202
I'm not Ionely!

00:14:34.639 --> 00:14:36.004
Oh, Seiran!

00:14:37.676 --> 00:14:40.201
- Please come and join us.
- No, I...!

00:14:40.278 --> 00:14:42.007
Yeah, come and join us!

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:47.848
Come to think of it, it's actually your fault
that I'm here drinking all alone!

00:14:49.354 --> 00:14:50.514
You heard the man.

00:14:57.863 --> 00:14:59.455
Big broth...

00:14:59.531 --> 00:15:00.293
Your Majesty!

00:15:00.365 --> 00:15:02.833
What's with that disgusting sound
you just made?!

00:15:03.168 --> 00:15:04.294
Uh, nothing.

00:15:04.369 --> 00:15:05.996
You sit down, too!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:16.640
So, Koyu, what makes you say
that I'm to blame for your drinking?

00:15:16.715 --> 00:15:19.650
- Ah, it's not that important.
- Come on.

00:15:19.718 --> 00:15:21.879
I'm very interested
in hearing about it.

00:15:21.953 --> 00:15:24.148
Koyu. Give it up and tell us.

00:15:24.556 --> 00:15:25.955
I'd be interested in listening...

00:15:26.024 --> 00:15:27.992
...to any stories concerning Bro...
um, ah, Seiran.

00:15:28.627 --> 00:15:30.060
Well, about that.

00:15:30.128 --> 00:15:33.996
It's a story that goes back
to when I was a helpless young boy.

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:39.297
I was suddenly adopted by Reishin
and brought back to his estate.

00:15:40.105 --> 00:15:42.073
Without any explanation.

00:15:42.374 --> 00:15:46.242
I asked him.
"Why are you adopting me?"

00:15:46.945 --> 00:15:49.038
He recognized your potential
with one glance!

00:15:49.114 --> 00:15:51.344
You were as irresistible
as a cute little puppy!

00:15:51.416 --> 00:15:53.646
Wrong! I was a substitute!

00:15:53.718 --> 00:15:55.185
A substitute?

00:15:55.253 --> 00:15:56.413
For whom?

00:15:56.855 --> 00:15:59.756
I was adopted
about thirteen years ago.

00:16:00.225 --> 00:16:03.092
Think back to what was going on in
Shoka Hong's household at that time.

00:16:04.362 --> 00:16:05.590
Don't tell me...!

00:16:06.164 --> 00:16:09.998
"I heard that my beloved big brother
just took in a young boy recently.

00:16:10.302 --> 00:16:12.896
In order to experience similar hardship,
I've decided to...

00:16:12.971 --> 00:16:15.906
...randomly choose a child to adopt
and raise as well."

00:16:16.641 --> 00:16:18.165
Those were his words!

00:16:18.243 --> 00:16:20.677
And it just so happened
that the one he saw was...

00:16:20.745 --> 00:16:24.146
At that moment, my life ended.

00:16:26.351 --> 00:16:30.754
You have Shoka, so it's fine for you,
but I ended up with that Reishin!

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:35.216
However I must add,
I'm where I am today, thanks to you.

00:16:36.795 --> 00:16:39.958
Anyway, drink up!
No, I'll do the drinking!

00:16:41.399 --> 00:16:44.095
We get it. Come on, let's call it a night.
I'll take you home.

00:16:44.169 --> 00:16:46.000
I don't wanna go home!

00:16:46.071 --> 00:16:47.732
I-Is he all right?

00:16:47.806 --> 00:16:49.205
You can stay here.

00:16:49.274 --> 00:16:52.937
Take this opportunity to talk privately
with the king. Come on. Let's go.

00:16:53.011 --> 00:16:55.571
Stop it! I'm not done drinking!

00:16:55.647 --> 00:16:58.548
If you drink any more,
you'll collapse before you make it home.

00:16:58.617 --> 00:17:02.713
If that happens, I wonder if he'd
still take me back. No, maybe not.

00:17:03.421 --> 00:17:07.187
Even someone like Koyu
can get that drunk.

00:17:08.059 --> 00:17:09.526
Big brother.

00:17:10.061 --> 00:17:12.325
You're drunk too, aren't you,
Your Majesty.

00:17:12.898 --> 00:17:15.594
I'm completely useless.

00:17:15.667 --> 00:17:17.965
Shurei is suffering such hardship.

00:17:18.036 --> 00:17:20.334
And all I can do
is watch from the shadows.

00:17:21.706 --> 00:17:23.765
Watching over her
from the shadows is enough.

00:17:23.842 --> 00:17:25.867
You created a path for Lady Shurei.

00:17:25.944 --> 00:17:28.913
What you need to do now is support her
along that path the best you can.

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:32.780
I'm... not even able to do
as much as you.

00:17:36.421 --> 00:17:39.288
I should be heading back, too.
I'll take you to your room.

00:17:45.864 --> 00:17:47.092
I drank too much.

00:17:47.165 --> 00:17:50.225
Oh, my.
You're in a miserable state.

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:56.866
Honestly. I don't recall having raised
such a hopeless man.

00:17:57.409 --> 00:18:02.711
If that's the case, why don't you just
adopt a child more to your liking?!

00:18:11.656 --> 00:18:14.557
It seems Shurei stayed
in the Archives again last night.

00:18:14.626 --> 00:18:17.060
Yes. She's been working very hard.

00:18:19.698 --> 00:18:23.395
You've mastered the art
of making very nice tea.

00:18:23.835 --> 00:18:26.770
I remember when you used to put
the tea leaves directly into the cup...

00:18:26.838 --> 00:18:28.806
...and pour hot water on top of them.

00:18:29.674 --> 00:18:32.142
Would you please forget about
such things from the past?

00:18:32.777 --> 00:18:34.438
- Seiran.
- Yes?

00:18:34.512 --> 00:18:37.072
You should live your life
the way you want to.

00:18:38.350 --> 00:18:41.717
Ever since my wife and I took you in,
and chose a name for you...

00:18:41.786 --> 00:18:44.482
...I've thought of you as my own.

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:46.655
Master Shoka.

00:18:46.725 --> 00:18:49.353
Parents shouldn't burden
their children...

00:18:49.427 --> 00:18:52.089
...so there's no need
for you to worry about me.

00:18:52.764 --> 00:18:56.325
There's still plenty of time before
Shurei's placement will be decided.

00:18:56.401 --> 00:18:58.369
Take your time and think things over.

00:19:01.106 --> 00:19:02.368
Master Shoka.

00:19:02.874 --> 00:19:04.967
Would it be all right to invite
a troubled young man...

00:19:05.043 --> 00:19:07.011
...to our home this evening?

00:19:10.749 --> 00:19:11.909
Please.

00:19:16.588 --> 00:19:19.318
This will be my first time
polishing a king's shoes!

00:19:20.158 --> 00:19:21.557
Are you finding this difficult?

00:19:21.626 --> 00:19:24.959
No. Polishing shoes
has taught me a great deal.

00:19:25.163 --> 00:19:26.289
I see.

00:19:27.165 --> 00:19:30.498
Rather than worrying about me,
please worry more for Miss Shurei.

00:19:31.002 --> 00:19:33.129
Things have been much,
much harder for her.

00:19:33.772 --> 00:19:35.137
- Eigetsu.
- Yes?

00:19:36.107 --> 00:19:37.631
This is for you.

00:19:37.709 --> 00:19:39.142
What is it?

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:44.977
It's the seal of the Royal Family.
If anything should happen, use this.

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:48.349
B-But it would be better for
Mr. Seiran to have something like this!

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:50.445
No. With his current rank...

00:19:50.522 --> 00:19:53.082
...Seiran is not permitted
to be by Shurei's side at all times.

00:19:54.959 --> 00:19:56.153
I understand.

00:19:59.998 --> 00:20:02.523
I may be the only person who can do
no more than worry...

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:04.693
...powerless to do anything.

00:20:04.769 --> 00:20:06.168
But at least...!

00:20:08.606 --> 00:20:09.937
Shoka did?

00:20:10.008 --> 00:20:11.999
Yes. He asked for you to come.

00:20:12.444 --> 00:20:14.036
What for?

00:20:14.112 --> 00:20:16.672
I've passed on the message.
Excuse me.

00:20:18.817 --> 00:20:20.182
What could it be?

00:20:21.886 --> 00:20:23.353
Excuse me.

00:20:25.423 --> 00:20:26.617
Koyu.

00:20:27.392 --> 00:20:28.518
Welcome.

00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:30.191
Come this way, won't you?

00:20:40.305 --> 00:20:44.207
It's rather unusual for you
to invite me over, Shoka.

00:20:44.876 --> 00:20:46.776
I don't think it's any more unusual...

00:20:46.845 --> 00:20:48.710
...than that expression
on your face right now.

00:20:51.516 --> 00:20:55.384
That plum tree was sent by Reishin
earlier this year.

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:58.780
He sent it right after he heard that
the king had given us a cherry tree.

00:20:59.457 --> 00:21:02.392
Is it because the plum tree will bloom
earlier than the cherry tree?

00:21:02.927 --> 00:21:04.895
No. It's because he's always liked...

00:21:04.963 --> 00:21:07.864
...both the blossoms
and fruit of the plum the most.

00:21:07.932 --> 00:21:10.901
But we don't have even one
plum tree at home.

00:21:11.936 --> 00:21:15.099
My younger brother has never been one
to be frank about his preferences.

00:21:17.142 --> 00:21:19.269
He doesn't like the Hong family.

00:21:20.011 --> 00:21:21.774
Nevertheless,
he could not escape...

00:21:21.846 --> 00:21:24.178
...from becoming
the head of the Hong family.

00:21:25.650 --> 00:21:28.414
I believe he doesn't want you
to be bound to them.

00:21:29.087 --> 00:21:31.555
Once he grants you
the Hong family name...

00:21:31.623 --> 00:21:34.285
...you'll be drawn into that
ugly darkness that swirls within.

00:21:35.493 --> 00:21:38.189
Reishin, himself,
could not escape it.

00:21:38.263 --> 00:21:39.787
So how could
he possibly let someone...

00:21:39.864 --> 00:21:41.855
...so important to him
suffer the same fate?

00:21:43.701 --> 00:21:46.135
He wants you to be able to choose
your own path in life.

00:21:46.404 --> 00:21:50.431
I believe that's why he gave you
the family name of Ri.

00:21:51.442 --> 00:21:53.672
Ri means plum, right?

00:21:54.846 --> 00:21:58.441
The Ko in Koyu means crimson,
even deeper than red.

00:21:58.950 --> 00:22:01.885
Yu speaks of the way water flows.

00:22:01.953 --> 00:22:04.786
This reflects how he takes pride in you
as his own son...

00:22:04.856 --> 00:22:08.792
...as well as his hopes that you will
live a life that is free, like flowing water.

00:22:09.127 --> 00:22:12.221
Even for my younger brother,
he did well to pick such a fine name.

00:22:13.231 --> 00:22:15.028
I had no idea.

00:22:15.099 --> 00:22:17.033
A child knows not
of his parent's feelings.

00:22:17.101 --> 00:22:19.365
Though I think there's
nothing wrong with that.

00:22:20.738 --> 00:22:21.898
Shoka.

00:22:21.973 --> 00:22:22.962
Yes?

00:22:24.309 --> 00:22:25.799
Thank you so much.

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:28.078
Actually, you should be
thanking Seiran.

00:22:28.546 --> 00:22:31.777
He's the one who asked me
to listen to your troubles.

00:22:32.417 --> 00:22:34.908
- Yes.
- And General Ran as well.

00:22:35.687 --> 00:22:37.120
He also asked me.

00:22:37.755 --> 00:22:39.780
He said that since you prefer not to
talk about private matters...

00:22:39.858 --> 00:22:41.655
...I'd probably be the only one
you'd open up to when it comes to...

00:22:41.726 --> 00:22:43.318
...issues regarding Reishin.

00:22:43.528 --> 00:22:45.928
You're very fortunate
to have such a great friend.

00:22:50.902 --> 00:22:53.302
Shuei! That was
none of your business!

00:22:53.371 --> 00:22:55.669
Why is it okay with Seiran,
but not with me?

00:22:55.740 --> 00:22:57.173
Because!

00:22:57.909 --> 00:23:00.241
My, my.
The Hong family's popularity...

00:23:00.311 --> 00:23:03.474
...and their ability to capture
people's hearts really is something.

00:23:06.551 --> 00:23:09.281
Reishin and I are
within Shoka's hold...

00:23:09.354 --> 00:23:11.049
...the king is completely
in Shurei's hands...

00:23:11.122 --> 00:23:13.716
...and they have someone as outstanding
as Seiran serving them.

00:23:16.961 --> 00:23:21.694
If those three put their minds to it, they
could easily take control of this country.

00:23:22.901 --> 00:23:23.868
Yeah.

00:23:30.508 --> 00:23:35.605
You've always led a very carefree life
and right now

00:23:35.747 --> 00:23:42.311
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:42.420 --> 00:23:47.483
And while you are fighting
Ioneliness somewhere

00:23:47.592 --> 00:23:52.586
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:53.665 --> 00:23:58.125
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:59.671 --> 00:24:04.802
You are just like me

00:24:05.543 --> 00:24:10.071
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:10.148 --> 00:24:16.053
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:17.021 --> 00:24:22.823
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:22.927 --> 00:24:27.796
I will always think of you

00:24:28.933 --> 00:24:41.607
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:45.016 --> 00:24:45.850
Next Episode

00:24:45.850 --> 00:24:47.719
Next Episode
Cleaning toilets, polishing shoes...

00:24:47.719 --> 00:24:47.752
Next Episode

00:24:47.752 --> 00:24:48.119
Next Episode
...organizing paperwork...
Boy, it's been really busy.

00:24:48.119 --> 00:24:49.921
Next Episode
There Are No Demons in this World
...organizing paperwork...
Boy, it's been really busy.

00:24:49.921 --> 00:24:51.923
Next Episode
There Are No Demons in this World
I must say,
it's starting to take its toll.

00:24:51.923 --> 00:24:51.956
Next Episode
There Are No Demons in this World

00:24:51.956 --> 00:24:53.558
Next Episode
There Are No Demons in this World
No, pull yourself together, Shurei!

00:24:53.825 --> 00:24:57.192
I'm not about to simply give up this
dream that I worked so hard to achieve!
